type InstantiateOrigin = frame_system::EnsureSigned<AccountId>;
```

Any KYC Level 1 account (basic identity verification) can upload and deploy an ink! contract. On a chain that also manages government payroll, land titles, and citizen identity, deploying a contract that interacts with these systems is available to any sufficiently-verified citizen.

The auditor must explicitly determine: is this intentional open-platform policy, or was the default never reviewed? Neither answer is wrong — but if it is intentional, it must be documented as a deliberate policy decision with its risk implications.

