BelizeChain's oracle system is the trust root for KYC attestations, sanctions screening, merchant verification, DEX exchange rates, and governance voter eligibility. Compromising the oracle layer compromises all of these simultaneously — without touching the consensus, cryptography, or networking layers that traditional blockchain security audits focus on. The oracle is the most centralized component on BelizeChain and the most consequential to compromise.

